<title>USA: Belmont Homes says CEO Jerold Kennedy dies.</title>
<headline>Belmont Homes says CEO Jerold Kennedy dies.</headline>
<dateline>BELMONT, Miss. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belmont Homes Inc said Monday its president and chief executive officer Jerold Kennedy died Sunday after a bout with lung cancer.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said a replacement has not yet been named.</p>
<p>The company announced in March that Kennedy was taking medical leave of absence, and that John Allison was named the acting president and chief executive officer.</p>
